{"id":"cultura","lemma":"cultura","pos":"noun","rank":1931,"glosses":["culture","knowledge","erudition"],"ipa":"/kulˈtuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"culturas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cultura.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ellas tienen su propia cultura.","en":"They have their own culture.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/642189"},{"text":"Estudiar las culturas de otros países es divertido.","en":"It's fun to learn about foreign cultures.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/534358"},{"text":"Aprendí sobre la cultura griega.","en":"I learned about Greek culture.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1152229"},{"text":"Hay muchas culturas en la Tierra.","en":"There are many cultures on Earth."},{"text":"La cultura destruye a las lenguas.","en":"Culture destroys languages.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35386"}]}